function epicCount(){return state.bag.filter(function(f){return FISH[f.id].rarity>=3&&FISH[f.id].category!=='legend';}).length;}
var modalActionOnly=false,modalOpenedAt=0,modalArmedButton=null;
function modal(html,actionOnly){modalActionOnly=actionOnly===true||phase==='result'||!!pendingCatch;modalOpenedAt=performance.now();modalArmedButton=null;$('modal').removeAttribute('data-sheet');if(sceneGesture)sceneGesture.cancel();if(phase==='charging')cancelCharge();hold=false;$('modal-body').innerHTML=html;if(window.ReedArt)window.ReedArt.paintUI($('modal-body'));$('modal').hidden=false;$('modal-close').hidden=modalActionOnly;var focus=modalActionOnly?$('modal-body').querySelector('button[data-action]'):$('modal-close');if(focus)focus.focus();}
function closeModal(explicit){if(modalActionOnly&&explicit!==true)return;modalActionOnly=false;modalArmedButton=null;window.pendingImport=null;if(pendingCatch){keepCatch();return;}$('modal').hidden=true;hold=false;}
function confirmAction(title,text,action){modal('<h2 id="modal-title">'+title+'</h2><p>'+text+'</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="secondary" data-action="close">再想想</button><button class="primary" data-action="'+action+'">确认</button></div>');}
function esc(value){return String(value).replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/"/g,'&quot;');}
function methodName(f){return f.category==='crab'?'蟹笼捕获':f.category==='direct'?'直接上钩':f.category==='legend'?'初代鱼王':f.category==='family'?'二代鱼王':f.category==='night'?'夜市垂钓':'鱼竿垂钓';}
function bookGrid(){var currentDistribution=bookFilter==='available'?SELECT.distribution(selectionContext(1)):null,list=FISH.filter(function(f){if(!state.book[f.id])return false;if(bookSearch&&f.name.indexOf(bookSearch)<0)return false;if(bookFilter==='legend')return f.category==='legend'||f.category==='family';if(bookFilter==='crab')return f.category==='crab';if(bookFilter==='available')return f.category==='crab'?RULES.available(f,state,POOLS,{cast:1,method:'crab'}):!!currentDistribution[f.id];return true;});var hidden=FISH.length-Object.keys(state.book).length;return '<div class="book-match">已发现 '+Object.keys(state.book).length+' 种 · 还有 '+hidden+' 种等待相遇</div><div class="book-grid">'+list.map(function(f){return '<button class="book-tile" data-book="'+f.id+'">'+artCanvas(f.id)+'<strong class="rarity-'+f.rarity+'">'+f.name+'</strong><small>'+methodName(f)+' · '+RULES.seasonsFor(f)+'</small><span class="fish-availability">✓ 已收集</span></button>';}).join('')+'</div>'+(list.length?'':'<div class="empty mystery-empty"><span aria-hidden="true">?</span><p>水下的故事，还没有被发现。</p><small>钓到新的鱼，图鉴会自动解锁。<br>名字、外形和出没条件都留给下一次相遇。</small></div>')+(hidden?'<div class="mystery-footer"><span aria-hidden="true">?　?　?</span><small>未知鱼种的资料暂未公开</small></div>':'');}
function repaintFish(scope){if(window.ReedArt)window.ReedArt.paintUI(scope);Array.prototype.forEach.call(scope.querySelectorAll('[data-fish]'),function(cv){drawFish(cv.getContext('2d'),FISH[+cv.dataset.fish],cv.width/2,cv.height/2,cv.width/80);});}
function showBook(id){if(!state.book[id]){toast('钓到它之后，图鉴才会解锁。');return;}var f=FISH[id],record=state.book[id],reasons=RULES.reasons(f,state,POOLS,{cast:1,depth:(landFor(state,1)||{}).depth,magic:EQ.bait(state)==='magic',method:f.category==='crab'?'crab':'rod'}),routes=f.routes.map(function(r){return '<li><b>'+POOLS[r.pool].name+'</b> · '+RULES.seasonsFor(f,r.pool)+'</li>';}).join('');if(f.category!=='crab'&&!WORLD.kingAllowed(f,state,landFor(state,1)))reasons.push('需要指定钓位或瀑布潭落点');if(state.rod===4&&f.category!=='crab'&&f.category!=='direct'&&(f.difficulty>=50||f.category!=='rod'))reasons.push('训练竿无法钓取此鱼');modal('<div class="result"><h2 id="modal-title">'+f.name+'</h2>'+artCanvas(id,180,108)+'<div class="rarity rarity-'+f.rarity+'">'+RARITIES[f.rarity]+' · '+(f.category==='crab'||f.category==='direct'?'无需遛鱼':'难度 '+f.difficulty)+'</div><p>'+f.story+'</p></div><div class="requirements"><div><b>获取方式</b><span>'+methodName(f)+'</span></div><div><b>时段</b><span>'+RULES.timeText(f)+'</span></div><div><b>天气</b><span>'+{any:'任意天气',sun:'晴天',rain:'雨天'}[f.weather]+'</span></div><div><b>钓鱼等级</b><span>'+(f.level?'Lv.'+f.level:'不限')+'</span></div>'+(f.minCast?'<div><b>远投</b><span>'+(f.minDepth!==undefined?'离岸至少 '+f.minDepth+' 格':'力度 ≥'+Math.round(f.minCast*100)+'%')+'</span></div>':'')+(f.category==='night'?'<div><b>夜市</b><span>冬15–17日 · 17:00后</span></div>':'')+'</div><ul class="habitat-list">'+routes+'</ul><p class="availability-note">'+(reasons.length?'当前：'+reasons.join('；'):'✓ 当前条件满足，可以在这里尝试获取。')+'</p><div class="catch-metrics"><div><strong>'+(record?record.count:'—')+'</strong><small>累计获取</small></div><div><strong>'+(record?record.best:'—')+'</strong><small>最大纪录 cm</small></div><div><strong>'+f.price+'</strong><small>基础售价</small></div></div>');var cv=$('modal-body').querySelector('canvas');drawFish(cv.getContext('2d'),f,90,54,2.25);}
function trapBait(){return EQ.stock(state,state.selectedBait)>0?state.selectedBait:state.bait>0?'bait':'none';}
function trapPanel(){var p=POOLS[state.pool],placed=state.traps.filter(function(t){return t.pool===state.pool;}),mature=placed.filter(function(t){return t.readyDay<=state.day;}).length,canPlace=(p.type==='fresh'||p.type==='sea')&&state.pool!==18,free=state.trapOwned-state.traps.length,bait=trapBait();return '<div class="trap-panel"><div><strong>蟹笼 · '+p.name+' · '+placed.length+'笼</strong><small>'+(mature?mature+'笼可以收获。':placed.length?'明早可收获。':'尚未放置。')+'空闲 '+free+' · '+(state.profession10==='luremaster'?'无需鱼饵':EQ.baits[bait]?EQ.baits[bait].name+' '+EQ.stock(state,bait)+'份':'没有鱼饵')+'</small></div><div class="trap-actions">'+(placed.length?'<button class="small-btn" data-action="harvest-trap" '+(!mature?'disabled':'')+'>收获1笼</button>':'')+'<button class="small-btn" data-action="place-trap" '+(!canPlace||free<=0||bait==='none'&&state.profession10!=='luremaster'?'disabled':'')+'>放置1笼</button></div></div>';}

function calendarModal(){if(!idleOnly())return;var d=RULES.date(state),next=(d.season+1)%4,days=29-d.day;modal('<h2 id="modal-title">四季日历</h2><p>'+dateLabel()+' · '+DAY.label(state.minutes)+'<br>每季28天，日期随睡眠自然前进。</p><div class="season-strip">'+RULES.seasons.map(function(n,i){return '<span class="'+(i===d.season?'chosen':'')+'">'+n+'</span>';}).join('')+'</div><div class="calendar-actions"><button data-action="go-home">回小屋睡觉</button><button data-action="rest-next-season">连续休息'+days+'天，到'+RULES.seasons[next]+'季</button><button data-action="night-market">休息到下次夜市</button><button data-action="use-rain" '+(!state.rainTotems?'disabled':'')+'>雨水图腾 ×'+state.rainTotems+'</button></div><p class="panel-note">没有直接切换季节。连续休息会逐日推进日期，并消耗大家族挑战天数。雨水图腾影响次日天气。</p><div class="family-card"><b>大家族挑战</b><p>'+(RULES.family(state)?'进行中：剩余'+(state.familyUntil-state.day+1)+'天 · 已获'+state.familyCaught.length+'/5。':'Lv.10解锁，持续3天；请为旅行与睡眠留好时间。')+'</p><button class="small-btn" data-action="start-family" '+(RULES.family(state)||level()<10?'disabled':'')+'>开启挑战</button></div>');}

function seasonGo(n){if(n!==(RULES.date(state).season+1)%4){toast('只能通过连续休息前往下一季。');return;}requestSeasonRest();}

function specialAction(a){if(a==='energy'){energyModal();return true;}if(a==='water-info'){waterInfoModal();return true;}if(a==='calendar'){calendarModal();return true;}if(!idleOnly())return true;
if(a==='rest-day'){finishDay(false);return true;}if(a==='go-home'){if(state.home)sleepModal();else goHome();return true;}if(a==='rest-next-season'){requestSeasonRest();return true;}
if(a==='wait-time'){toast('时间会自然流逝，想快进可回小屋休息。');return true;}
if(a==='night-market'){var d=RULES.date(state),target=Math.floor((state.day-1)/112)*112+99;if(state.day>target||(state.day===target&&state.minutes>=1380))target+=112;var days=target-state.day;confirmAction('休息到夜市？','将连续休息'+days+'天至冬15日清晨，届时仍需等到17:00开放。挑战期限也会正常流逝。','confirm-night-rest');return true;}
if(a==='confirm-night-rest'){var target=Math.floor((state.day-1)/112)*112+99;if(state.day>target||(state.day===target&&state.minutes>=1380))target+=112;while(state.day<target)DAY.next(state,false);state.home=true;closeModal();render();save();toast('已休息到'+dateLabel()+'清晨6点，夜市17点开放。');return true;}
if(a==='buy-trap'){var trapCost=state.profession5==='trapper'?1000:1500;if(state.coins>=trapCost&&state.trapOwned<20&&EQ.base(state)>=3){spend(trapCost);state.trapOwned++;toast('蟹笼已放入背包，可在鱼池页放置。');}render();save();return true;}
if(a==='buy-rain'){if(state.coins>=100){state.coins-=100;state.rainTotems++;toast('获得雨水图腾，在日历中使用。');}render();save();return true;}
if(a==='use-rain'){if(state.rainTotems>0){state.rainTotems--;state.rainDay=state.day+1;toast('雨水图腾已安排次日降雨。');}calendarModal();render();save();return true;}
if(a==='start-family'){if(level()>=10&&!RULES.family(state)){state.familyUntil=state.day+2;state.familyCaught=[];state.familyRewarded=false;toast('大家族挑战开始！3天内收集5种二代鱼王。');}calendarModal();render();save();return true;}
if(a==='place-trap'){var p=POOLS[state.pool];if((p.type==='fresh'||p.type==='sea')&&state.pool!==18&&state.traps.length<state.trapOwned&&(trapBait()!=='none'||state.profession10==='luremaster')){var chosen=trapBait();if(state.profession10!=='luremaster'){EQ.addBait(state,chosen,-1);if(!EQ.stock(state,state.selectedBait))state.selectedBait='none';}state.traps.push({pool:state.pool,readyDay:state.day+1,bait:chosen,targetedFish:state.targetedFish});toast('蟹笼已放好，休息一天后收获。');}render();save();return true;}
if(a==='harvest-trap'){var index=state.traps.findIndex(function(t){return t.pool===state.pool&&t.readyDay<=state.day;});if(index>=0){if(bagSize()>=EQ.capacity(state)||state.bag.length>=5997){toast('鱼篓格子已满，先卖掉一些鱼吧。');return true;}var placed=state.traps[index],context=selectionContext();context.bait=placed.bait||'bait';context.targetedFish=placed.targetedFish;var f=SELECT.trap(context);state.traps.splice(index,1);if(f.category==='junk'){finishDebris(f,'trap');return true;}fishGame={fish:f,out:99,source:'trap',trapQuality:context.bait==='lucky'?'silver':'normal',quantity:context.bait==='wild'&&Math.random()<.25?2:1,treasureWon:false};finishGame(true);}return true;}
if(a==='legacy-book'){modal('<h2 id="modal-title">旧版纪念收藏</h2><p>旧版原创鱼种与价值已保留，不会被改名为星露谷鱼种，也不占77个新图鉴条目。</p><ul>'+Object.keys(state.legacyBook).map(function(n){return '<li>'+esc(n)+' ×'+state.legacyBook[n].count+'</li>';}).join('')+'</ul>');return true;}return false;}
function landFor(s,power){return WORLD.landing(s,power,EQ.level(s));}
function syncLifeHUD(){var d=RULES.date(state),w=RULES.weather(state,POOLS[state.pool]),h=Math.floor(state.minutes/60),m=state.minutes%60,part=DAY.label(state.minutes),land=castLanding||landFor(state,phase==='charging'?castPower:1);uiText('clock',part+' '+('0'+h%24).slice(-2)+':'+('0'+m).slice(-2));$('clock-dial').style.setProperty('--hand',((state.minutes-360)/1200*360-90)+'deg');$('clock-dial').setAttribute('data-part',part);$('clock').classList.toggle('late',state.minutes>=1380);uiText('weather',{rain:'☂ 雨',storm:'ϟ 雷雨',green:'☂ 绿雨',sun:'☀ 晴',wind:'〰 微风',snow:'❄ 雪',indoor:'◇ 室内'}[w]);uiText('energy-value',Math.ceil(state.energy)+' / '+state.maxEnergy);uiStyle('energy-fill','width',state.energy/state.maxEnergy*100+'%');$('energy-btn').setAttribute('aria-label','体力 '+Math.ceil(state.energy)+'，点击补给或休息');$('energy-btn').classList.toggle('low',state.energy<35);uiHTML('home-btn',state.home?'回水边':state.returnScepter?'⌂ 回家<small>立即返回</small>':'⌂ 回家<small>路程20分钟</small>');$('spot-btn').hidden=state.home;uiText('spot-btn',WORLD.spot(state).label+' ▾');uiText('scene-water',state.home?'河畔小屋 · 安心休息':(land?'抛出 '+land.distance+' 格 · 水深 '+land.depth+' 格'+(land.region==='waterfall-basin'?' · 瀑布潭':''):'这个方向没有可达水面'));if(state.home){uiText('location-name','河畔小屋');uiText('location-desc','把鱼竿放好，明早六点再出发。');$('bait-btn').disabled=true;}else{$('bait-btn').disabled=false;}}
function clearFishing(){if(sceneGesture)sceneGesture.cancel();lessonStep=0;lessonHold=0;window.ReedAudio.setActive(true);window.ReedAudio.endCharge();castTimers.forEach(clearTimeout);castTimers=[];fishGame=null;pendingRoll=null;pendingCatch=null;hold=false;activePointer=null;paused=false;castLanding=null;castAge=0;waterEffects=[];$('game-overlay').hidden=true;$('pause-overlay').hidden=true;$('modal').hidden=true;setPhase('idle');}
function finishDay(forced,reason){if(dayEnding)return;dayEnding=true;clearFishing();var summary=DAY.next(state,forced);setMobileView('home');render();save();modal('<h2 id="modal-title">'+(forced?'你被送回了小屋':'新的一天')+'</h2><p>'+(forced?(reason==='energy'?'体力耗尽，晕倒在水边。':'已经凌晨两点，身体撑不住了。')+'<br>救助费用 '+summary.lostCoins+' 金币，遗失随身鱼获 '+summary.lostFish+' 条。':'你在小屋里好好休息了一夜。')+'</p><div class="morning-card"><b>'+dateLabel()+' · 清晨 06:00</b><span>体力 '+Math.ceil(state.energy)+' / '+state.maxEnergy+'</span><small>图鉴、鱼竿和已解锁的水域都保留。</small></div><button class="primary" data-action="wake">起床，开始新的一天</button>'+((EQ.base(state)>=5&&!state.profession5||EQ.base(state)>=10&&!state.profession10)?'<button class="wide-link" data-action="growth">选择新的钓鱼职业</button>':'')+'');dayEnding=false;}
function goHome(){if(state.home){if(!travelTo(state.pool))return;state.home=false;closeModal();setMobileView('home');render();$('scene-tip').textContent='等风来，也等一条鱼。';save();return;}if(phase==='fishing'){toast('先完成或放弃这一竿，再回家。');return;}clearFishing();if(!state.returnScepter){state.minutes=Math.min(1560,state.minutes+20);if(state.minutes>=1560){finishDay(true,'late');return;}}state.home=true;setMobileView('home');render();save();$('scene-tip').textContent='小屋里的床已经铺好了。';}
function sleepModal(){if(!idleOnly())return;modal('<h2 id="modal-title">今晚好好休息</h2><p>'+dateLabel()+' · '+DAY.label(state.minutes)+'<br>现在睡觉，次日清晨6点醒来。主动睡觉不会扣钱或丢失鱼获。</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="secondary" data-action="close">再待一会儿</button><button class="primary" data-action="sleep-now">睡到明早6点</button></div><button class="wide-link" data-action="rest-next-season">连续休息到下一季</button>');}
function requestSeasonRest(){if(!idleOnly())return;var d=RULES.date(state),days=29-d.day;confirmAction('连续休息到'+RULES.seasons[(d.season+1)%4]+'季？','会回到小屋，逐日睡过'+days+'天。挑战期限与蟹笼日期都会正常前进；不会扣钱或丢鱼。','confirm-season-rest');}
function energyModal(){if(!idleOnly())return;modal('<h2 id="modal-title">体力与补给</h2><p>当前体力 '+Math.ceil(state.energy)+' / '+state.maxEnergy+'<br>每次抛竿消耗约 '+(state.enchantment==='efficient'?0:DAY.energyCost(level())).toFixed(1)+' 点，提前收竿也不退还。</p><p>体力耗尽或凌晨02:00会被送回小屋，扣除10%金币（上限1000），清空随身鱼获，次日6点醒来。</p><div class="calendar-actions"><button data-action="eat-food" '+(!state.food||state.energy>=state.maxEnergy?'disabled':'')+'>吃饭团 +45体力 ×'+state.food+'</button><button data-action="buy-food" '+(state.coins<20?'disabled':'')+'>买饭团 · 20金币</button><button data-action="go-home">回家休息（'+(state.returnScepter?'立即':'路程20分钟')+'）</button><button data-action="workshop">小屋工坊</button></div>');}
function spotModal(){if(!idleOnly()||state.home)return;var m=WORLD.map(state.pool,state.spot);modal('<h2 id="modal-title">选择钓位</h2><p>上方显示当前钓位的原作地图。选择下方地点前往另一处岸边；码头、岛屿和岸线都会影响离岸深度。</p><canvas id="spot-map" class="spot-map" width="300" height="182" aria-label="'+POOLS[state.pool].name+'当前钓位的原作地图"></canvas>'+m.spots.map(function(p,i){var temp=Object.assign({},state,{spot:i,aim:null}),landing=landFor(temp,1);return '<button class="spot-choice" data-spot="'+i+'"><b>'+p.label+'</b><span>'+(i===(state.spot||0)?'当前 · ':'')+(landing?'最远'+landing.distance+'格 · 水深'+landing.depth+'格':'')+'</span></button>';}).join('')+'<p class="panel-note">鱼王要满足指定钓位、季节和深度。主画面向水面滑动，滑得越远投得越远；也可按住蓄力。抛出格数是距离，水深格数用于判断鱼种。</p>');var cv=$('modal-body').querySelector('canvas'),c=cv.getContext('2d');c.imageSmoothingEnabled=false;c.save();c.scale(cv.width/960,cv.height/580);WORLD.draw(c,state.pool,state,0,true);m.spots.forEach(function(p,i){var x=m.native?p.source[0]-m.origin[0]:p.x,y=m.native?p.source[1]-m.origin[1]:p.y;if(x<0||x>=30||y<0||y>=18)return;c.fillStyle=i===state.spot?'#fff3ad':'#df5940';c.fillRect(x*32+7,y*32-15,8,40);c.fillRect(x*32+15,y*32-15,28,18);});c.restore();cv.addEventListener('click',function(e){var rect=cv.getBoundingClientRect(),x=(e.clientX-rect.left)/rect.width*30,y=(e.clientY-rect.top)/rect.height*18,best=0,distance=999;m.spots.forEach(function(p,i){var px=m.native?p.source[0]-m.origin[0]:p.x,py=m.native?p.source[1]-m.origin[1]:p.y;if(px<0||px>=30||py<0||py>=18)return;var d=Math.pow(px-x,2)+Math.pow(py-y,2);if(d<distance){distance=d;best=i;}});if(distance>20)return;state.spot=best;state.aim=null;state.facing=facingForAim();castLanding=null;closeModal();render();save();});}

function tickLife(dt){if(startupOpen||!ready||tutorialActive()||state.home===undefined||paused||!$('modal').hidden||mobileView!=='home'||['fishing','hooking','result','retracting'].indexOf(phase)>=0)return;var update=DAY.tick(state,dt);if(update.passout){finishDay(true,'late');return;}if(update.changed){syncLifeHUD();syncMusicScene();laterSave();if(state.minutes===1440)toast('已经午夜了，记得回小屋睡觉。');else if(state.minutes===1500)toast('凌晨一点了，尽快回家。');}}
function selectionContext(power,saveState){var s=saveState||state;power=power===undefined?castPosition:power;var landing=landFor(s,power),actual=landing?landing.depth:0,depth=Math.min(5,actual+(MECH.inBubbles(s,power)?1:0)),bait=EQ.bait(s);return {pool:s.pool,season:RULES.date(s).season,level:EQ.level(s),depth:depth,actualDepth:actual,fish:FISH,bait:bait,targetedFish:s.targetedFish,curiosity:!!EQ.counts(s).curiosity,mariner:s.profession10==='mariner',available:function(f,o){return !!landing&&(s.rod!==4||f.category==='direct'||f.difficulty<50&&f.category==='rod')&&WORLD.kingAllowed(f,s,landing)&&RULES.available(f,s,POOLS,{cast:power,depth:o.depth,method:o.method||'rod',magic:bait==='magic'});}};}

function fishChoice(){return SELECT.draw(selectionContext());}
